@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 2NDHAND EXTERNAL_V2 Order states (2 Oct 2026)
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
[*] --> WAITING_PAYMENT : create / EXTERNAL_V2 / reserve
WAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : cancel / 30min expiry
WAITING_PAYMENT --> WAITING_SELLER_SHIP : simulated Payment / Receipt / HELD
WAITING_SELLER_SHIP --> REFUNDED : paid+72h without shipment / full refund
WAITING_SELLER_SHIP --> SHIPPING_TO_CENTER : frozen return snapshot / carrier / tracking
SHIPPING_TO_CENTER --> RECEIVED_AT_CENTER : actual Inspector receive
RECEIVED_AT_CENTER --> INSPECTING : assigned work
INSPECTING --> RESULT_NOTIFIED : atomic result / qualifying certificate / window
RESULT_NOTIFIED --> SHIPPING_TO_BUYER : timely CONFIRM / Inspector final dispatch
RESULT_NOTIFIED --> RETURNED_TO_SELLER : REJECT / timeout / negative; dispatch then actual Seller or Admin receipt
SHIPPING_TO_BUYER --> DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER : trusted Admin demo TO_BUYER event / receipt+72h
SHIPPING_TO_BUYER --> COMPLETED : actual Buyer receipt / one RELEASE
SHIPPING_TO_BUYER --> DELIVERY_DISPUTED : report without waiting for event / HELD
DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER --> COMPLETED : timely Buyer receipt OR eligible AUTO / one RELEASE
DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER --> DELIVERY_DISPUTED : timely report / HELD
DELIVERY_DISPUTED --> COMPLETED : scoped audited Admin resolution / RELEASE
DELIVERY_DISPUTED --> REFUNDED : scoped audited Admin non-receipt / full refund
RETURNED_TO_SELLER --> REFUNDED : separate settlement / item-only or full by policy/cause
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]
note right of RESULT_NOTIFIED
  Positive atomic availability+72h decision window.
  No Buyer response -> SYSTEM timeout, never fake REJECT/CONFIRM.
  Return transit remains RESULT_NOTIFIED with TO_SELLER shipment.
  Tracking/event alone cannot establish actual returned receipt.
end note
note right of DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER
  Receipt window = trusted TO_BUYER event server time+72h.
  Separate from result window; tracking alone never starts AUTO.
  Fresh DB clock after locks governs writes; report blocks AUTO.
end note
note right of RETURNED_TO_SELLER
  Actual receipt commits before refund attempt.
  Failure remains HELD and retries the same policy/cause once.
end note
note bottom of REFUNDED
  Positive reject/timeout: item1200 + retained100/50 = held1350.
  Negative/no-ship/non-receipt/legacy: full1350.
  Original charge unchanged; Product CANCELLED; review forbidden.
end note
legend bottom
  LEGACY_V1 keeps historical Courier/proof/full-refund rules.
  Six no-HTTP jobs; inspection overdue escalates only.
  Backend candidate is separate from E / shared / Android acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
